msgstr ""

#: admin/Settings.php:436
msgid "Decide whether content has to be approved in the workflow before it can be published. Off changes nothing. Log only lets people publish but records every publish that skipped approval. Enforce blocks publishing until the content is approved; administrators can still publish, and that is recorded."
msgstr ""

#: admin/Settings.php:441
msgid "Every publish and unpublish of workflow content is recorded in its activity history in all three modes. Changes written straight to the database by other code are not covered."
msgstr ""

#: admin/Settings.php:455
msgid "Off"
msgstr ""

#: admin/Settings.php:456
msgid "Log only"
msgstr ""

#: admin/Settings.php:457
msgid "Enforce"
msgstr ""

